<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth one bln pounds. [CORRECTED 07:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth one bln pounds. [CORRECTED 07:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth one billion pounds for auction on August 4 and issue on August 5 when 182-day (corrects from 91-day) bills worth 702.375 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 8.820 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 Egyptian pounds)</p>
</text>
